or firewood in turret fund, i paid\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0059\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me how much I spent in total last week, please?\", \"Could you let me know what's on at Kampot Deli, please?\", \"Would you mind telling me Saoirse Lehtonen's mobile number?\", \"Sorry, just quickly before I forget, could you tell me what's due this weekend?\", \"On a different note, would you mind inventing a PIN for my new card, please?\"], [\"total spent last week?\", \"what's on at Kampot Deli\", \"Saoirse Lehtonen mobile number\", \"wait, due this weekend?\", \"make up a PIN for my new card\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0060\", \"v\": [[\"I've been clearing out my phone book since half these people I never talk to anymore, so could you bin the Kerem Westova contact for me?\", \"Ah, actually, I've just remembered I might need him for the flat deposit, so scratch that and put it back, please.\"], [\"umm can you delete, uh, the Kerem Westova contact?\", \"oh wait no, no, scratch that, can you put it back?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0061\", \"v\": [[\"ok so umm can you square up my turret fund balance with Raffaella?\", \"right, and uh what've I got on in five days?\", \"hmm ok can you, uh, move the second one to friday and, um, cancel the third one?\"], [\"settle up with Raffaella, turret fund\", \"what's on in five days?\", \"second one to friday, cancel third\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0001\", \"v\": [[\"umm who's, uh, who owes me money at the moment?\"], [\"I've lent out a fair bit over the last few months and honestly I've lost track, so could you tell me who still owes me money?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0002\", \"v\": [[\"delete the fields note\", \"anyone owe me cash?\", \"total?\", \"pics with any of them?\", \"put the second one in the Summer 2027 album\"], [\"can u delete the fields note pls\", \"also does anyone owe me cash\", \"what does that come to altogther\", \"got any pics with any of them in\", \"put the second one in the Summer 2027 album thx\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0003\", \"v\": [[\"That whole thing is sorted now and I don't need the reminder hanging around anymore, so could you please delete the Borislav note?\"], [\"delete the Borislav note pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0004\", \"v\": [[\"I was trying to remember that evening out, and I know I snapped a few, so could you pull up the photos taken at Dubrovnik Pavilion?\", \"I think I paid for something that night too, so what do my expenses have on that one?\"], [\"umm can you show me the, uh, photos from Dubrovnik Pavilion?\", \"oh ok and, um, is there anything in my expenses about that?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0005\", \"v\": [[\"which Bromow tasks havent i done yet\", \"diff thing, show me the pics in the Ravello Leisure album\", \"nvm\"], [\"Bromow tasks still open?\", \"Ravello Leisure album photos\", \"never mind\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0007\", \"v\": [[\"umm what've I got on in, uh, five days?\", \"ok can you call off the, um, the sitar one?\", \"different thing, uh, can you find anything to do with octopus?\", \"ah ok, can you make the repair one, um, an hour later?\"], [\"I'm trying to figure out whether I'm free at the weekend for a trip, so could you tell me what's on in five days?\", \"That's too much for one day, honestly, so could you call off the sitar one for me?\", \"Separate question, I've got a feeling a few things have piled up around it, so can you find anything to do with octopus?\", \"The mechanic said they're running behind this week, so could you push the repair one an hour later?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0008\", \"v\": [[\"I've got something coming up with Runnou and I've completely forgotten when, so could you tell me when my Runnou thing is?\", \"Different thing, I'm putting together a little album for my mum, so what pictures do I have from last month?\", \"Oh, that's more than I thought, how many is that altogether?\", \"Also, the bonnet has been bugging me for weeks, so could you remind me to sort out the bonnet next friday at 3pm?\"], [\"when's my Runnou thing?\", \"pics from last month\", \"how many?\", \"remind me: sort out the bonnet next friday at 3pm\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0009\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me what Runnou things I have, please?\", \"Would you mind deleting the fourth one?\", \"Oh, I'm sorry, I didn't mean that, could you bring it back, please?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me where it was taken?\", \"On another matter, could you tell me when my accordion thing is?\", \"Also, would you mind showing me the last photo I took?\"], [\"Runnou stuff?\", \"delete the fourth one\", \"no, bring it back\", \"where was it taken?\", \"when's the accordion thing?\", \"last photo I took?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0011\", \"v\": [[\"scallop club locker entry\", \"who do I still owe?\", \"phoned the second one, log it\"], [\"umm can you pull up the, uh, scallop club entry in my locker? just the entry, not the password\", \"ok and, um, who do I still have to pay back?\", \"oh right, I, uh, phoned the second one, can you log that?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0012\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please tell me what the actual scallop club password is?\"], [\"whats the scallop club password\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0013\", \"v\": [[\"umm when's my, uh, octopus repair?\", \"ok so can you make me a task to, um, print the octopus booking on friday?\", \"oh and, uh, the crayon?\", \"and, um, what about the lacemaking viewing?\"], [\"when do i have the octopus repair\", \"add a task to print the octopus booking friday\", \"and the crayon?\", \"and the lacemaking viewing?\"]]}","ttft_ms":6882,"type":"result","duration_ms":26346,"uuid":"bffc1a39-8483-4a2c-9425-e86003b5ba81","ttft_stream_ms":1725,"time_to_request_ms":136,"first_content_frame_ms":1726,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":21910239,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278460816.7976,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
